Core excerpts and the operational stable-UUID patch derive from graphiti_core.
Source paths, versions, original source hashes and excerpt hashes are recorded
in manifest.json. Type annotations are removed only at execution time by the
synthetic test harness; function bodies in the recorded excerpts are retained.

The hermes_main and patches/* excerpts are user-owned operational wrappers.
They are included only as source evidence; whole startup modules are never
imported by the synthetic differential runner.

Full prompt sources and the stdlib-only dedup helper retain their original
Apache-2.0 notices. Their source hashes are pinned in prompt-source-hashes.json
and dedup-source-hash.json. The prompt compiler produces inert Rust data.
